<h3 id="breadcrumb-props" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#breadcrumb-props"><span>Breadcrumb Props</span></a></h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>属性</th>
<th>说明</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th>默认值</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>max-count</td>
<td>最多展示的面包屑数量(0表示不限制)</td>
<td><code v-pre>number</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>0</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>routes</td>
<td>设置路径</td>
<td><code v-pre>BreadcrumbRoute[]</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>separator</td>
<td>分隔符文字</td>
<td><code v-pre>string | number</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>/</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>custom-url</td>
<td>自定义链接地址</td>
<td><code v-pre>(paths:string[])=&gt;string</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>sticky</td>
<td>是否开启滚动吸附（基于 Affix 组件）</td>
<td><code v-pre>boolean</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>false</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>offset-top</td>
<td>距窗口顶部达到指定偏移量后触发，仅 <code v-pre>sticky</code> 为 <code v-pre>true</code> 时生效</td>
<td><code v-pre>number</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>0</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>offset-bottom</td>
