<td><code v-pre>number</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>target</td>
<td>滚动容器，默认 <code v-pre>window</code>，仅 <code v-pre>sticky</code> 为 <code v-pre>true</code> 时生效</td>
<td><code v-pre>string | HTMLElement | Window</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
